tomáticas</li><li>• Monitoreo de rendimiento</li></ul></div></div><div class="rounded-lg border shadow-sm bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm border-white/10 text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105"><div class="flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-palette w-10 sm:w-12 h-10 sm:h-12 text-[#00F5D4] mb-4"><circle cx="13.5" cy="6.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="10.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="8.5" cy="7.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><circle cx="6.5" cy="12.5" r=".5" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12s4.5 10 10 10c.926 0 1.648-.746 1.648-1.688 0-.437-.18-.835-.437-1.125-.29-.289-.438-.652-.438-1.125a1.64 1.64 0 0 1 1.668-1.668h1.996c3.051 0 5.555-2.503 5.555-5.554C21.965 6.012 17.461 2 12 2z"></path></svg><h3 class="font-semibold tracking-tight text-white text-lg sm:text-xl">Desarrollo SaaS personalizado</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base">Construye soluciones de software escalables adaptadas a tus necesidades</p></div><div class="p-6 pt-0"><ul class="text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-2"><li>• Desarrollo full-stack</li><li>• Stack tecnológico moderno</li><li>• Arquitectura escalable</li></ul></div></div><div class="rounded-lg border shadow-sm bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm border-white/10 text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105"><div class="flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-column w-10 sm:w-12 h-10 sm:h-12 text-[#00F5D4] mb-4"><path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16"></path><path d="M18 17V9"></path><path d="M13 17V5"></path><path d="M8 17v-3"></path></svg><h3 class="font-semibold tracking-tight text-white text-lg sm:text-xl">Auditorías de automatización y análisis</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base">Análisis integral y recomendaciones de optimización</p></div><div class="p-6 pt-0"><ul class="text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-2"><li>• Análisis de procesos</li><li>• Cálculos de ROI</li><li>• Hoja de ruta de optimización</li></ul></div></div><div class="rounded-lg border shadow-sm bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm border-white/10 text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1"><div class="flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target w-10 sm:w-12 h-10 sm:h-12 text-[#00F5D4] mb-4"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg><h3 class="font-semibold tracking-tight text-white text-lg sm:text-xl">Plantillas listas para usar</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base">Plantillas de automatización preconstruidas para necesidades comerciales comunes</p></div><div class="p-6 pt-0"><ul class="text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-2"><li>• Plantillas específicas de la industria</li><li>• Implementación rápida</li><li>• Flujos de trabajo personalizables</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative z-10 px-4 py-20 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#00F5D4] to-[#667EEA] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Servicios de automatización centrales</h2><p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-300">Capacidades de automatización esenciales que impulsan el crecimiento empresarial</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 sm:gap-12"><div class="space-y-6"><div class="flex items-start space-x-4"><div class="w-10 sm:w-12 h-10 sm:h-12 bg-[#00F5D4]/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bot w-5 sm:w-6 h-5 sm:h-6 text-[#00F5D4]"><path d="M12 8V4H8"></path><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"></rect><path d="M2 14h2"></path><path d="M20 14h2"></path><path d="M15 13v2"></path><path d="M9 13v2"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Chatbots inteligentes</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base">Bots de servicio al cliente y generación de leads impulsados por IA</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start space-x-4"><div class="w-10 sm:w-12 h-10 sm:h-12 bg-[#00F5D4]/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-5 sm:w-6 h-5 sm:h-6 text-[#00F5D4]"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Gestión automatizada de anuncios</h3><p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base">Campañas publicitarias inteligentes que se optimizan solas</p></div></div></div><div class="space-y-6"><div class="flex items-start space-x-4"><div class="w-10 sm:w-12 h-10 sm:h-12 bg-[#00F5D4]/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chart-column w-5 sm:w-6 h-5 sm:h-6 text-[#00F5D4]"><