te=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down" style="--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width);"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative z-10 px-4 py-20 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#00F5D4] to-[#667EEA] bg-clip-text text-transparent">¿Listo para automatizar tu éxito?</h2><p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-300 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Únete a cientos de empresas que ya están ahorrando tiempo y aumentando ganancias con nuestras soluciones de automatización IA.</p><div class="flex justify-center"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&_svg]:pointer-events-none [&_svg]:size-4 [&_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary hover:bg-primary/90 h-11 rounded-md bg-gradient-to-r from-[#00F5D4] to-[#00D4AA] hover:from-[#00D4AA] hover:to-[#00C499] text-[#0F172A] font-semibold text-lg px-8 py-4 shadow-lg">Comenzar hoy<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2 w-5 h-5"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></button></div></div></section><section class="relative z-10 px-4 py-16"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="overflow-hidden"><img   src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Automated Product Research Workflow" class="w-full h-auto"></div></div></section><footer class="relative z-10 px-4 py-12 border-t border-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2"><div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center"><img   src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Autoro Tech Logo" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain rounded-full"></div><div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Autoro Tech</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Automatización IA para el crecimiento empresarial</p></div></div><p class="text-gray-400 mb-4">Ayudamos a las empresas a automatizar procesos, optimizar flujos de trabajo y generar más ingresos a través de soluciones IA inteligentes.</p></div><div><h4 class="font-semibold mb-4">Compañía</h4><ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-400"><li><a href="#" class="hover:text-[#00F5D4] transition-colors">Política de privacidad</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 mt-8 pt-8 text-center text-gray-400"><p>© 2024 Autoro Tech. Todos los derechos reservados.</p></div></div></footer></div></div>
  
